  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 C1 1A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 10 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 9B 11}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞埃癸斯拿起老式机器人，\n　仔细端详着……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这位机器人先生\n缺少一个齿轮，\n似乎无法活动了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这位机器人先生\n应该也有被制造出来的使命……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 7E 0B}它是否完成了使命呢……\n我有些在意。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 23 04}……嗯，不过现在，\n还是赶快去找玲比较重要吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 81}，齿轮的事\n顺便记在心上就好。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞要是找到合适的齿轮，\n　就带过来试试吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5E 0B}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}不过，刚才在上层发现的齿轮，\n竟然与缺失的部位\n完全吻合！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e725_160.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 10 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}既然如此，\n请马上装上去试试。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
